      {
        "name": "places/ChIJE2lypU8HBDQRT9C77JjCii4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s0d09EaHFaV0ppZGxCRVdIcG9OSEU1U21OUlNXYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "8 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "這裡的甜點都很好吃，但有些份量偏小，價格卻偏高。就我個人而言，我覺得這裡的甜點（尤其是刨冰）分量有點少，價格卻不高，不過他們用的是新鮮和冷凍水果，而不是冰塊加糖漿，而且上面還有水果和其他配料，所以感覺還是物有所值的。店員很友好，上菜速度也很快，但就我的經驗來說，這家店比較小，所以可能需要等一會兒才能找到座位。總的來說，體驗很棒！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "desserts here are all delicious, but some options are quite pricey for smaller portions. personally, i think the portions (especially for the shaved ices) are a bit small for the high price, but they used fresh and frozen fruit rather than ice with syrup and there was fruit and other toppings on it so that made it seem more worth the money. staff are nice and the desserts come pretty fast, but in my experience this place is a bit small so it might take a little while to get a seat. overall experience was great!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
